OL,3,GNEWSAMicrosoft scrambles to solve
OL,4,Aglobal outage affecting Outlook and
OL,5,ATeams but says fixes not going 'as
OL,6,Aexpected'
OL,7,
OL,8,FMore than 430 million people use
OL,9,FMicrosoft 365 apps, and tech giants
OL,10,FOpenAI and Anthropic have reported
OL,11,Fproblems as a result of the outage
OL,13,FIn India, an executive at a brokerage
OL,14,Ffirm explains the "challenge" of trying
OL,15,Fto contact clients; Japan's government
OL,16,Fsays its shared IT platform is
OL,17,Fdisrupted; Australia's spy and federal
OL,18,Fpolice agencies also report issues -
OL,19,Fbut say it's "very much" email-related
